DESCRIPTION:Address:\nTed Rogers School of Management\nCPA Lounge - Room T
 RS 1-003 (7th Fl)\nThe entrance to the workshop venue is located mid-block
  on the south side of Dundas Street West (Between Best Buy & JOEYS Restaur
 ant). Upon entering the building\, proceed to the 7th floor using the elev
 ators. When you exit the elevators\, turn right and walk to the end of the
  hallway. The CPA Lounge is on your right.\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nWe're 
 on the path to a new kind of web\, with an uncertain future: AI-based user
  agents are fast-becoming a core interface to the internet. Platforms have
  increasingly seized control of the publisher-reader relationship: search 
 engines are squeezing out web publishers to juice ad revenue\, while socia
 l platforms have captured audiences with algorithmic reach and paid promot
 ion.\nHow can publishers engage in this platform shift beyond being a data
 set to be scraped? How can we avoid being trapped by a new wave of mega-pl
 atforms? And how can publishers on the web reach real users\, build lastin
 g…\n\nHosted by Team PfP✨
