DESCRIPTION:Address:\nBeyond Space\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nAn extra Octob
 er meeting\, bringing Fashion Book Club to the east end!\nWe'll be gatheri
 ng at La Maison Atelier\, the concept store of Toronto label Beyond Space\
 , to read Nathalie Khan's "Cutting the Fashion Body: Why the Fashion Image
  Is No Longer Still."\nExploring how fashion film has changed the way we s
 ee clothes and the body\, Khan's essay asks what means for fashion to exis
 t in motion. We'll screen three of the four fashion films Khan references\
 , and discuss how moving images shape the way we see and make fashion toda
 y.\nSee you there!\nPDF here\n\nHosted by Fashion Book Club & BEYOND SPACE
  INC.
